<h2>Buyer protection on a resale marketplace</h2>
<p>Seat Outlet is a resale marketplace, which means sellers set their own prices. A ticket can cost more or less than its original face value. Buyer protection does not change the price. It covers the order after you buy, through the TicketNetwork 100% guarantee described above.</p>
<p>That makes comparing listings the first step. Look at section, row, quantity and the full cost before you pay. If you are curious why prices swing, read <a href="/why-are-concert-tickets-so-expensive">why concert tickets are so expensive</a>.</p>

